bbits and bears, so I would love it if you drew them around him, similar to your usual artworks like this: https://twitter.com/chi________v/status/1505858180718333953?s=21&t=60vMd6pH7Ya5BNOEimo8nA\n\nI love the domesticity in your artworks, so I would love it if the background is indoors with warm tones, as if it is snowing outside and he is keeping warm inside. \n\nFeel free to give him casual but comfy clothes to match the atmosphere.\n\nThank you for considering my request!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10EN63QTbAJVN-ZtfKGl8L-LJSuQxmdnN", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@chi__p__v/works/2", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bb27f919/uploads/origins/621ec669-6e85-460f-ba2c-4262cfdfa499?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36a598137b62f559ff569083c53e7579", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bb27f919/uploads/origins/621ec669-6e85-460f-ba2c-4262cfdfa499?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36a598137b62f559ff569083c53e7579, https://si.imgix.net/bb27f919/uploads/origins/621ec669-6e85-460f-ba2c-4262cfdfa499?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0498cb2158bf30a8f82bdc14e880cf91 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bb27f919/uploads/origins/621ec669-6e85-460f-ba2c-4262cfdfa499?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aa55b4301aca40ca843eb7370eba3d26 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "あなたの作品を愛しています。\n私のOCリリーの写真をお願いします。\nパジャマを着て\n朝食を作っているところ。\nキッチンで\n猫2匹と一緒に。\n\nそのようなことを除けば、構図や風景はすべてあなたの自由です。\n\n(参考までに)一人暮らしで、友達と遊んだり、コスプレをしたり、がんばってる女の子。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/Blj4WmI", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@chi__p__v/works/1", "scraped_at": "2026-02-14T14:57:26.827357+00:00", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4b676c5f/uploads/origins/aeaee7d5-fcd0-4f6f-bbe5-ce898756ec4c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&c